---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: project.run(args)
---
Index every project now (search does this on its own)

Usage: claudegrep index [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --all           Use every project's sessions, not only those of the current directory
      --since <WHEN>  Only sessions active since WHEN: a date (2026-10-14) or an age (30m, 6h, 2d, 1w, 3mo)
      --until <WHEN>  Only sessions active until WHEN: a date (whole day included) or an age
      --db <FILE>     Database with the index, the transcript archive and the settings [env: CLAUDEGREP_DB=[ROOT]/db.sqlite]
  -h, --help          Print help
